<h2 id=3D"intuition">Intuition</h2>
<p>At first, it might seem overwhelming to deal with expressions that inclu=
de a variety of elements like negative numbers, nested expressions inside p=
arentheses, and numbers with multiple digits. The key to managing this comp=
lexity is to break down the problem into smaller, more manageable parts. Le=
t's first focus on evaluating simple expressions that contain no parenthese=
s.</p>
<p><strong>Handling positive and negative signs</strong><br>
