<p><strong>Processing numbers with multiple digits</strong><br>
<!-- -->Another complexity in this expression is that some numbers have mul=
tiple digits. We=E2=80=99ll need a way to build numbers digit by digit unti=
l we reach the end of the number. We can build a number using the variable =
<code>curr_num</code>, which is initially set to 0. Every time we encounter=
 a new digit, we multiply <code>curr_num</code> by 10 and add the new digit=
 to it, effectively shifting all digits to the left and appending the new d=
igit.</p>
